{"version":1,"key":"card:724","content":{"id":724,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d56489df-e639-4268-9f18-1c24440e64d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果说"},{"type":"content-link","refId":723,"contentId":5968,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"7a690272-96c4-4836-9f1a-414a183dafbb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"库存周期"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"是企业的短期呼吸，那产能周期就是企业的长期心跳。在宏观经济学中，产能周期通常被称为朱格拉周期，是一个持续约 7~11 年的中长周期。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2455eaa9-4f86-404b-9747-0c04e058e31a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它的核心逻辑和库存周期一脉相承：供给对需求的响应存在时间差，只不过波动的对象从库存变成了固定资产（厂房、设备、生产线），而固定资产的建设和淘汰需要的时间远比补库存长得多，所以周期也更长、波动也更剧烈。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a447d3b8-d342-4791-be5b-589387a9b007","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"举个例子，假设某个行业突然迎来需求爆发，现有的产能根本吃不下这么多订单，产品供不应求，价格飙升。企业一看利润丰厚，纷纷决定扩建厂房、购买设备、新建生产线。但盖一座工厂不是一朝一夕的事，等所有企业的新产能同时投产，市场上的供给一下子远远超过了需求，产能过剩了。为了抢客户，大家只能打价格战，利润急剧下降甚至亏损。熬不下去的企业破产清算（产能"},{"type":"content-link","refId":707,"contentId":5949,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"0e14dbef-164c-417a-8107-1974a3d8cec5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"出清"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"），直到多余的产能被消化殆尽，供需重新平衡，新一轮周期才开始酝酿。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1e195136-fbc9-4ac3-81fc-867c7cfbf6a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从这个过程中可以提炼出四个阶段："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"30aa03d1-5518-4130-8485-c0d8339f24d9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"464e3426-3721-40ef-9aac-d9ce94de71c3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b77b2f40-7a79-4e98-84b0-278254a7be1a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"产能不足期：需求爆发，现有产能跟不上，产品涨价，企业利润丰厚"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c617117a-e9af-4914-8297-84176546a5fd","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e875a8a1-66cc-4e1f-a605-efb87d67dfbb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"产能扩张期：企业大规模投资建设新产能，行业一片热火朝天"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"156d32f6-fd18-4a64-bee3-651734ec51d5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"66ef8bc4-0612-4fa6-98ee-27cdba1113ec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"产能过剩期：新产能集中释放，供给远超需求，价格战爆发，利润骤降"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"036235c0-9722-48da-bb3c-055f92945e17","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac4d34e4-f6c3-4de3-a9fa-a72084e6b5bf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"产能出清期：亏损企业退出市场，设备报废或转让，供给逐步收缩至与需求匹配"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"00b814dc-dbf0-4a99-8642-ff537e16ee25","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"理解产能周期的意义在于，它决定了一个行业中长期的投资节奏。当你看到全行业都在疯狂扩产时，往往意味着过剩和价格战就在不远处；而当行业一片萧条、产能大量出清时，反而可能是下一轮繁荣的起点。"}]}],"tags":["经济/产能周期","概念"],"createTime":1779014472606,"updateTime":1791094954983,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791094954983},"links":{"card:723":{"key":"card:723","type":"card","id":723},"card:707":{"key":"card:707","type":"card","id":707}}}